{"id": "De3s5v3vIzE", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"TV\" to get Clean your TV of Ads and Bloatware with Claude Code.\n\nPeople are now hacking their TVs with Claude Code to remove all the bloatware and ads.\n\nAnd it's blowing up on the internet right now.\n\nIt started when someone on Twitter gave Claude Code their TV's model number.\n\nThen Claude Code found the TV on Wi-Fi.\n\nIt removed all 25 bloatware apps, sponsored ads, and all the tracking codes.\n\nAnd it built a new home screen from scratch.\n\nThink of it like a deep clean for your TV.\n\nThat turned into a free GitHub repo that lets anyone do the same.\n\nIt already has over 16k stars.\n\nYou paste one prompt into Claude Code with your TV model.\n\nIt removes everything you don't want.\n\nThen it installs a clean home screen that looks like Apple TV.\n\nOr you can even code your own.\n\nIt already works with over 170 TV models.\n\nAnd if you don't like it, you can restore everything.\n\nWith just one command.\n\nSo you can always go back.\n\n#claudecode #cleanyourtv #vibecoding #githubrepo #aihacking", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1792830478, "like_count": 116571, "comment_count": 32995, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1144633195171078a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.276, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOkeYdU7VnYqTII_7qpMr8vNeiRrManA_nxYW5mGJMpXR5jxqyeBBr_THPmXJ91A50elnHVFHNz1__9oZ-bh9HllnbECdCNVKjfWZc.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=AdopiDcfsAhgfBznQb4AygsY1fsBKaWiH8qlYDbYnGU7ap1gGlC8kPyu28yDF_sektk&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Ftqa2C-DbSgQ7kNvwFaYKVN&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=2Qza2U7lCAdsud-5w60L5w&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQJkdBvHVQQhoID0VwTRXIJ2IbSgQ3O7hqLGmleuPhGuA